名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">乘法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168737\"><ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>掛<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>算<rp>(</rp><rt>ざん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>暗記<rp>(</rp><rt>あんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The children are learning the multiplication tables by heart.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">駆けっこ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かけっこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赛跑；短跑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">可決</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かけつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通过；采纳（议案、法案等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191099\"><ruby>委員会<rp>(</rp><rt>いいんかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>議案<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎあん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>可決<rp>(</rp><rt>かけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The committee passed the bill.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">かける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">挂起；悬挂；吊起；升起；覆盖；铺盖；罩住；铺在……上面；戴上；佩戴；打电话；拨打；花费；消耗；耗费；浇上；洒上；溅上；泼上；打开；启动；调至；播放；给……添麻烦；使……感到不便；给……造成负担；相乘；乘以；锁上；上锁；坐下；搁置；靠；支撑；捆绑；束缚；赌；打赌；押注；下注；施