=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">程度；范围；分量；平衡；状态；情况；（身体）状况；健康状态；调整；节制；调节；加法和减法；略有……的迹象；略带……的样子；恰好适合……</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74914\">お<ruby>肉<rp>(</rp><rt>にく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>焼<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>加減<rp>(</rp><rt>かげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、いかがなさいますか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How would you like your steak cooked?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">過去</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">过去；往日；昔日；（不愿为人所知的）往事；黑历史；过去时；过去式；前世；前生</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161409\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつまでも<ruby>過去<rp>(</rp><rt>かこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にこだわらないようにと<ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>こころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がけている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I try not to dwell on the past.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下降</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下降；下落；下跌；衰退；衰落；沉降</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">加工</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><