><rt>かざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The hall was decorated with Japanese paintings.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">火山</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かざん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">火山</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211955\">その<ruby>火山<rp>(</rp><rt>かざん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>溶岩<rp>(</rp><rt>ようがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The volcano poured molten rock.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">菓子</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">糖果；糕点；甜食；点心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222701\">この<ruby>菓子<rp>(</rp><rt>かし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>自由<rp>(</rp><rt>じゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にお<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please help yourself to these cakes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">貸し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">借贷；出租；租赁；人情；恩惠；债务；义务；债权人；借贷方式；贷方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202119\">でも、これで